+
+**High**
+- `modules/avro/modulith-example/src/main/resources/avro/schemas/acme/modulith_example/account/event/AccountEvent.avsc:4`: the file is `AccountEvent.avsc` but the record inside is named `AccountPlanEvent`. It looks copy-pasted from `CompliancePlanEvent`. Failure: `modulith-example` loads it with `getSchema(name = "AccountEvent")`, which finds the file by path, so it silently registers and serialises the record as `acme.modulith_example.account.event.AccountPlanEvent`. Any `.avsc` that references `...event.AccountEvent` by full name won't parse. Confirmed. Fix: `"name": "AccountEvent"`.
