+
+**Critical**
+- `modules/package-migrator/domain/.../StaticPackageMigration.kt:70,48`: two checks run against the whole absolute path, not the path relative to the project root.
+  - `isWithinPackage` is a plain `contains(fromPath)` on the absolute path.
+  - `movePackage` replaces the first match anywhere in the absolute path.
