+  Failure: if the project root itself contains the package path (e.g. root `/x/com/example-svc`, package `com.example`), every file matches. The first match is in the root portion, so files get moved to `/x/<to>-svc/...`, outside the project, and the tree is destroyed. Confirmed. Fix: compare and rewrite `rootDirectory.path.relativize(path)` segment-wise.
