+**High**
+- `StaticPackageMigration.kt:57,70`: text and path replacement are plain substring matches with no identifier or segment boundaries. Failure: migrating `a.b.c`→`b.d` turns `a.b.common` into `b.dommon`, turns `xa.b.c` into `xb.d`, and rewrites any `a/b/c` substring in any file. Unrelated packages and files are silently corrupted. Confirmed. Fix: match with a boundary regex (`(?<![\w.])a\.b\.c(?![\w])`) and compare whole path segments.
