+- `modules/package-migrator/app/.../PackageMigrator.kt:8`: the target is the current working directory, and the README (`modules/package-migrator/README.md:16-20`) points at a file and a `targetProjectRootDirectory` constant that no longer exist. Failure: someone following the README edits only `migrations`, runs from the IDE (where the working directory is the tools repo), and migrates the tools repo itself. Confirmed. Fix: make the root a required CLI argument and fix the README.
