+- `StaticPackageMigration.kt:42,44`: excluded segments (`build`, `gradle`, `.git`, `.kotlin`) are skipped for text rewriting but not for directory moves. Failure: a subpackage named `gradle` or `build` under the migrated package (or the `build/` output) gets its directory moved, but its `package` declarations are never rewritten, so the result doesn't compile. Confirmed. Fix: apply the same exclusion filter in `directoriesWithinPackage`.
