+- `LicenseAudit.kt:113-120,256-260`: UNKNOWN findings caused by a transient POM fetch failure (`"missing"`) are cached at repo and component level. Failure: the resolver is meant to retry `"missing"`, but the repo cache short-circuits first, so a one-off network blip gives a permanent failure until `--force`. Confirmed. Fix: re-evaluate components whose `resolutionSource` is `missing`/`parent-missing`, and don't take the skip path when any exist.
