+- **Medium** — `.../event/SendPaymentCommand.kt:10` and `.../event/Deposit.kt:10` — There is no positive-amount check. `GenericCurrencyAmount` allows `units >= 0` and `CurrencyAmount.json` has `minimum: 0`.
