+
+- **Low** — `../acme-schema-catalogue/.../account/event/AccountEvent.avsc` (loaded at `AccountAvroSchemas.kt:39`) — The record is named `AccountPlanEvent`, a copy-paste leftover.
+  - **Scenario:** the Pulsar schema registry and any external consumer see the wrong record name for the account-events topic.
