+- **Low (test)** — `content/shared/account/serialization/avro/src/test/.../AccountEventAvroSerdeTests.kt:24` — The `"inbound-payment"` case builds an `OutboundPayment`.
+  - **Scenario:** the InboundPayment Avro serde is never round-trip tested.
