+- **Low (test)** — `content/shared/account/domain/test/utils/.../InternalAccountNumberTestFactories.kt:8` — `nextInt(0, 9)` has an exclusive upper bound.
+  - **Scenario:** generated account numbers never contain the digit 9.
+  - **Confidence:** confirmed.
