+- `CSVStandardsReportGenerator.kt:23` and `CSVRequirementsReportGenerator.kt:26`: `YearMonth.displayName()` defaults to `Locale.getDefault()` with the SHORT month style. The module has `WithDefaultLocale` but ignores it here.
+  - Failure: report dates change with the JVM locale ("Jan 2024" vs "janv. 2024").
