+  - Confidence: plausible.
+  - Fix: prepend `\uFEFF`.
+- `ApplicationImplementation.kt:57/118` (`processAsCompositeEvent`): the shared swissknife helper wraps the action in `runCatching`, so `CancellationException` is turned into a processing failure (nack) instead of propagating. This is the shared API's fault.
+  - Confidence: confirmed.
+  - Fix (in swissknife): rethrow `CancellationException` in `processAsCompositeEvent`.
+
